{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"zai-org/CodeGeeX4","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/135","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/135/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/135/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/135/events","html_url":"https://github.com/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/135","id":3484509385,"node_id":"I_kwDOMRdAoc7PsWTJ","number":135,"title":"安装 vscode 插件后时不时会无故弹出 git 对比工具","user":{"login":"greensea","id":619187,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTE4Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/619187?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/greensea","html_url":"https://github.com/greensea","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greensea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greensea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greensea/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greensea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greensea/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greensea/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greensea/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greensea/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greensea/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-10-05T07:34:24Z","updated_at":"2025-10-05T07:34:24Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 版本信息\nvscode 插件版本：2.21.0\nvscode 版本：1.99.2\n\n## 现象描述\n安装 CodeGeeX 插件之后，进行一些编码操作，之后就会在没有任何操作的情况下，频繁弹出 git 对比工具（在我这里用的是 meld）。\n\n经过排查，确定是 CodeGeeX 插件引起的（禁用插件之后不会再出现这个问题，启用插件并使用自动补全功能后，开始出现这个问题）。\n\n目前怀疑的原因是，我自定义了 git 的 diff 工具，而 CodeGeeX 插件调用了 git diff 命令，导致 git 对比工具频繁弹出。\n\n## 其他信息\n```\n$ git config --global --list\n\ndiff.external=/usr/local/bin/git-meld.sh\n...\n```\n\n/usr/local/bin/git-meld.sh 文件内容如下，作用就是调用 meld 进行对比：\n```\n\n#!/bin/sh \nmeld \"$2\" \"$1\"\nexit 0\n\n\n```\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/135/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/135/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[]}